" disk, is kept, and so is the template a disk was made from. If a host cannot"
" be checked, the VM is not destroyed."
msgstr "面板任一主机上其他虚拟机直接使用或作为其磁盘底层使用的文件会被保留，磁盘所基于的模板也会保留。如果某台主机无法检查，则不会销毁该虚拟机。"

#: instances/templates/instances/destroy_instance_form.html:44
msgid "Delete the NVRAM file (firmware settings). Untick to keep it."
msgstr "删除 NVRAM 文件（固件设置）。取消勾选则保留。"

